/* Driver 1 PC port - src/mdraw_asm.s (25 routines, 0x30380-0x317B0) translated to C on the PsyCross GTE.
 * The map model renderer behind DrawMapPSX: func_00030ED0 walks the build list, func_000307FC draws one model
 * and dispatches each polygon through the scratchpad table DrawMapPSX fills at 0x1F800080; the emitters,
 * subdividers (func_000305D0/func_0003110C) and the near-plane clipper (func_00031550..func_00031734) run on the
 * shared registers - kept as such (see asm_pc.h). Source: own translation (mechanical, mips2c.py); REDRIVER2's
 * DrawMapPSX/PlotBuildingModelSubdivNxN (Game/C/draw.c) is the closest D2 relative but not a twin. */
